        <dt>How do I install a game?</dt>
        <dd>Open <b>Apps &amp; Games</b> on the desktop, then <b>Games</b>, and double-click one. It downloads from the LAN and launches.</dd>
        <dt>Where are my files saved?</dt>
        <dd>On your USB stick (your home directory). It syncs automatically; pull it only when told it is safe.</dd>
        <dt>How do I chat?</dt>
        <dd>Open <b>NYET Messenger</b> - it auto-connects to the LAN IRC server and joins <code>#auditorium</code>.</dd>
        <dt>The internet does not work!</dt>
        <dd>Correct. There is no internet. That is the point.</dd>
        <dt>Who made this?</dt>
        <dd><b>LilWil</b>. Solo. Should have slept more. If it breaks, that's a feature.
        (Psst - try the Konami code on this page.)</dd>
